<title>CROATIA: Croatian central bank sells HRK 131.5 mln bills.</title>
<headline>Croatian central bank sells HRK 131.5 mln bills.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia's central bank sold 131.5 million kuna in 35- and 91-ddy bills on Wednesday, compared to 151.5 million at last week's auction.</p>
<p>&quot;The difference in the total is not large and roughly one half were new subscriptions,&quot; a bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Issued rates were flat at 7.0 and 8.5 percent, respectively. Full results on page  NBHT. -- Sandra Kalogjera, Zagreb Newsroom,</p>
</text>
